#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List backends available to you {#list-backends-available-to-you}"
msgstr "רשום את ה-Backends הזמינים לך {#list-backends-available-to-you}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use either Qiskit or IBM Quantum Platform to view a list of backends available to you, or to search for a particular backend.\n"
msgstr "ניתן להשתמש ב-Qiskit או ב-IBM Quantum Platform כדי לצפות ברשימת ה-Backends הזמינים לך, או לחפש Backend ספציפי.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"QPU names\">\n"
"QPUs hosted on IBM Cloud&reg; have names that begin with `ibm_*`. All QPUs are given a city name - for example, `ibm_kingston`. This name does not indicate where the actual QPU is hosted.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"שמות QPU\">\n"
"ל-QPUs המתארחים ב-IBM Cloud&reg; יש שמות המתחילים ב-`ibm_*`. לכל ה-QPUs ניתן שם של עיר - לדוגמה, `ibm_kingston`. שם זה אינו מציין היכן ה-QPU הפיזי מתארח.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-available\" label=\"View backends with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backends()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) method, as shown in the next code block. This method returns a list of [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-available\" label=\"View backends with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backends()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) method, as shown in the next code block. This method returns a list of [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instances.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        To run the following code, be sure you have already authenticated to the service. See [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) for more details.\n"
msgstr "        To run the following code, be sure you have already authenticated to the service. See [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) for more details.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        To search for a specific backend, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) method (note that this is singular: *backend*), which takes the name of the backend as the input parameter and returns an [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instance representing that particular backend:\n"
msgstr "        To search for a specific backend, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) method (note that this is singular: *backend*), which takes the name of the backend as the input parameter and returns an [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instance representing that particular backend:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-available\" label=\"View backends on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, navigate to the list of backends on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) (note that your selected region might impact the QPUs listed). Click the filter icon and choose either \"All my instances\" or a specific instance name to see the available QPUs.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-available\" label=\"View backends on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, navigate to the list of backends on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) (note that your selected region might impact the QPUs listed). Click the filter icon and choose either \"All my instances\" or a specific instance name to see the available QPUs.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   If you are logged in to a specific instance or region, or if you initialized the service with a specific instance or region by using `QiskitRuntimeService()`, only the backends available to you on that instance or region are returned.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   If you are logged in to a specific instance or region, or if you initialized the service with a specific instance or region by using `QiskitRuntimeService()`, only the backends available to you on that instance or region are returned.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter backends {#filter-backends}"
msgstr "סינון Backends {#filter-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties with Qiskit\">\n"
"        You can filter the available backends by their [configuration](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-configuration) or [status](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status). For more general filters, set the `filters` argument to a function that accepts a backend object and returns `True` if it meets your criteria. Refer to the [API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties with Qiskit\">\n"
"        You can filter the available backends by their [configuration](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-configuration) or [status](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status). For more general filters, set the `filters` argument to a function that accepts a backend object and returns `True` if it meets your criteria. Refer to the [API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) for more details.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        The following code returns only backends that fit these criteria and are available to you _on your currently selected instance_:\n"
msgstr "        The following code returns only backends that fit these criteria and are available to you _on your currently selected instance_:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are real quantum devices (`simulator=False`)\n"
msgstr "Are real quantum devices (`simulator=False`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are currently operational (`operational=True`)\n"
msgstr "Are currently operational (`operational=True`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Have at least a hundred qubits (`min_num_qubits=100`)\n"
msgstr "Have at least a hundred qubits (`min_num_qubits=100`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        A similar method is [`QiskitRuntimeService.least_busy()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#least_busy), which takes the same filters as `backends()` but returns the backend that matches the filters and has the least number of jobs pending in the queue:\n"
msgstr "        A similar method is [`QiskitRuntimeService.least_busy()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#least_busy), which takes the same filters as `backends()` but returns the backend that matches the filters and has the least number of jobs pending in the queue:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, view the table on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers). Click the filter icon to see filter options. You can filter by processor type and status. Note also that you can sort the table by any column by hovering over a column title, and then clicking the arrows that appear.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, view the table on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers). Click the filter icon to see filter options. You can filter by processor type and status. Note also that you can sort the table by any column by hovering over a column title, and then clicking the arrows that appear.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Static backend information {#static-backend-information}"
msgstr "מידע סטטי על Backend {#static-backend-information}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some information about a backend does not change regularly, such as its name, [version](#qpu-versioning), the number of qubits it has, its processor type (the bird family name, which indicates the [topology](#coupling-map) and approximate qubit count), and the types of features it supports. This information is available as attributes of the `backend` object. For a full list of attributes, see the [`IBMBackend` API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend).  Find more information on versioning in the [QPU versioning](#qpu-versioning) section below.\n"
msgstr "חלק מהמידע על Backend אינו משתנה באופן קבוע, כגון שמו, [גרסה](#qpu-versioning), מספר ה-Qubit שבו, סוג המעבד שלו (שם משפחת הציפור, המציין את [הטופולוגיה](#coupling-map) וספירת ה-Qubit המשוערת), וסוגי הפיצ'רים שהוא תומך בהם. מידע זה זמין כתכונות של אובייקט ה-`backend`. לרשימה מלאה של תכונות, ראה את [תיעוד ה-API של `IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend).  מצא מידע נוסף על גרסאות בסעיף [גרסאות QPU](#qpu-versioning) שלהלן.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A backend's region (the location of the data center where your data and experiments will be hosted and processed) is listed in its detailed information card on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "האזור של Backend (מיקום מרכז הנתונים שבו הנתונים והניסויים שלך יתארחו ויעובדו) מופיע בכרטיס המידע המפורט שלו בדף [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) ב-IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-backend\" label=\"View backend information with Qiskit\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-backend\" label=\"View backend information with Qiskit\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"IQP-backend\" label=\"View backend information on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"IQP-backend\" label=\"View backend information on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. Find backend information under the Details section of the card.\n"
msgstr "    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. Find backend information under the Details section of the card.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "QPU versioning {#qpu-versioning}"
msgstr "גרסאות QPU {#qpu-versioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each QPU has a version number in the form X.Y.Z (major.minor.revision). A circuit compiled for a given version number is guaranteed to run on that QPU. If the revision number changes, the circuit will continue to run. If the major or minor number changes, the circuit is not guaranteed to run, although it may do so.\n"
msgstr "לכל QPU יש מספר גרסה בצורה X.Y.Z (מייג'ור.מיינור.תיקון). מעגל שקומפל עבור מספר גרסה נתון מובטח לרוץ על אותו QPU. אם מספר התיקון משתנה, המעגל ימשיך לרוץ. אם מספר המייג'ור או המיינור משתנה, המעגל אינו מובטח לרוץ, אם כי ייתכן שיצליח.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The revision version number will increment for fixes that do not break the existing compiled circuit.\n"
msgstr "מספר גרסת התיקון יגדל עבור תיקונים שאינם שוברים את המעגל המקומפל הקיים.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The code example earlier in [this section](#static-backend-information) demonstrates how to find a backend's version. On IBM Quantum Platform, you can view the version on a QPU's detailed information card (click the QPU's name on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) table to open the card).\n"
msgstr "דוגמת הקוד שמוקדם יותר ב[סעיף זה](#static-backend-information) מדגימה כיצד למצוא את גרסת ה-Backend. ב-IBM Quantum Platform, ניתן לצפות בגרסה בכרטיס המידע המפורט של QPU (לחץ על שם ה-QPU בטבלת [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) כדי לפתוח את הכרטיס).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The conditions under which a version or revision number can change are listed in the following table.\n"
msgstr "התנאים שבהם מספר הגרסה או התיקון יכול להשתנות מפורטים בטבלה הבאה.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Major version | Minor version | Revision version |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Sample changes| Warmup / cool-down cycles | QPU software updates |\n"
"|Major changes to the control electronics| Swapping out some electronics, if the replacement appreciably affects operation| Manual calibrations to improve fidelities |\n"
"|Moving the QPU to a new location, if significant behavior changes result| Dropping a gate for some duration of time due to calibration issues, and corrections cannot readily be done in software| Small electronics changes that don’t affect operation |\n"
"| |Changing the direction of a CNOT gate | |\n"
"<span id=\"native-gates-ops\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""
"| גרסת מייג'ור | גרסת מיינור | גרסת תיקון |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|החלפת דגימות| מחזורי חימום / קירור | עדכוני תוכנה של QPU |\n"
"|שינויים מהותיים באלקטרוניקת הבקרה| החלפת חלק מהאלקטרוניקה, אם ההחלפה משפיעה מהותית על הפעולה| כיולים ידניים לשיפור נאמנויות |\n"
"|העברת ה-QPU למיקום חדש, אם נובעים מכך שינויי התנהגות משמעותיים| ביטול שער לפרק זמן מסוים עקב בעיות כיול, וכאשר לא ניתן לבצע תיקונים בתוכנה בקלות| שינויים קטנים באלקטרוניקה שאינם משפיעים על הפעולה |\n"
"| |שינוי כיוון שער CNOT | |\n"
"<span id=\"native-gates-ops\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported instructions {#supported-instructions}"
msgstr "הוראות נתמכות {#supported-instructions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each [processor family](/guides/processor-types) natively supports a limited set of instructions. This set includes single- and two-qubit gates, as well as non-unitary operations such as measure and reset. Every gate in the circuit must be translated (by the transpiler) to the elements of a QPU's supported instruction set before it can run on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "כל [משפחת מעבדים](/guides/processor-types) תומכת בצורה מובנית בסט מוגבל של הוראות. סט זה כולל שערי חד-Qubit ודו-Qubit, כמו גם פעולות לא-יוניטריות כגון מדידה ואיפוס. כל שער במעגל חייב להיות מתורגם (על ידי ה-Transpiler) לאלמנטים של סט ההוראות הנתמך של QPU לפני שיוכל לרוץ על ה-QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can view the supported instruction sets for a QPU with Qiskit. The IBM Quantum Platform Compute resources page lists only the supported unitary gates (basis gates) for a QPU.\n"
msgstr "ניתן לצפות בסטי ההוראות הנתמכות עבור QPU באמצעות Qiskit. דף ה-Compute resources של IBM Quantum Platform מפרט רק את שערי היוניטרי הנתמכים (שערי בסיס) עבור QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-native\" label=\"Find supported instructions with Qiskit\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  <Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-native\" label=\"Find supported instructions with Qiskit\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-basis\" label=\"Find basis gates on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-basis\" label=\"Find basis gates on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. The basis gates for that QPU are listed in the Details section.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. The basis gates for that QPU are listed in the Details section.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Table of supported instructions {#table-of-supported-instructions}"
msgstr "טבלת הוראות נתמכות {#table-of-supported-instructions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operation category |  Name |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Single-qubit gates | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Two-qubit gates | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Fractional gates | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (single-qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (two-qubit) |\n"
"| Non-unitary instructions | [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure), [`reset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Reset), [`measure_*`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) |\n"
"| Control flow | [`if_else`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) (classical feedforward) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| קטגוריית פעולה |  שם |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| שערי חד-Qubit | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
